Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:16.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We won't get another chance like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So let's enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:21.00,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Pft! In your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Finally, the Outside Kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.25,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I mean, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:28.72,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm walking on asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.76,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's go, MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.48,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H242726&}Starring in TSUMA FES Extreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.73,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Making final batten height adjustments!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:19.61,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,The road to one million subscribers...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:23.72,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Step three: collabing with famous streamers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.75,Default,Stage Director,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi-san, how's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.76,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Extremely good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:32.50,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\pos(134.5,14)\3c&HFFFFFF&}TSUMA-shi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.41,0:02:32.50,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(134.5,14)}T{\c&HFFFFFF&}SUMA-shi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:32.50,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\bord2\fnArial Black\an7\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(362.5,27)}Legendary streamer\Nknown as the {\c&H9C41E9&\bord2.5\3c&HFDFCFF&}Stream God
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.00,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.50,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,The legendary streamer known as the Stream God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:37.12,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,And we even get to collab \Nwith my hero, TSUMA-shi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.55,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\pos(320,105)\c&H80EDF6&\3c&H2A31D4&}MayoPan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, all eyes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:42.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here's the rundown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.93,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\c&H2C322F&\pos(220,180)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:43.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The event is split up into two parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Part one is the collab segments!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Part two is our original performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:50.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll get everyone's attention during \Nthe collab performances in part one,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:53.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and then unveil a song as MayoPan for \Nour original performance in part two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:57.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Followed by a music video going up \Non our channel right after the event!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A perfect plan to double our subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:05.58,DefaultItalics,Staff 2,0,0,0,,All TSUMA FES participants, \Nplease gather in the main green room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:10.37,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fscx80\fax0.2\c&H2C322F&\frz-10.3\t(26,1986,\fscx88\fscy108)\move(170,233.5,155.5,240,26,1986)}Main Green Room
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.29,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.41,Default,Performer 1,0,0,0,,Isn't that Masakichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.96,Default,Performer 2,0,0,0,,Oh, the former Hype-Sis member?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,474)\fnArial Black\c&H8456E5&\3c&HDEE1EF&\bord2\frz29.21\fax-0.4\pos(423.5,171)}Hype-Sis
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:19.88,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.37,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Glad to have you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.13,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,U-Um, th-thank you kindly for\N giving us this opportunity today—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:29.74,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,There's nothing I love more \Nthan seeing fresh talent grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:33.61,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Let's get along and have fun \Nmaking today's event a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:35.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So precious...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:37.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:38.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Gotta introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:41.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Y-You two are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.74,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Taromaru and Salamin! \NWe'll be your emcees for tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:49.79,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(102,157)}F. Taromaru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:49.79,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(102,157)}F{\c&HFFFFFF&}. Taromaru
