Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:54.54,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(227.5,224.5)}Sa{\c&HFFFFFF&}lami N. Cappuccino
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.77,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Salami N. Cappuccino!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.54,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,A beauty streamer popular with \Nwomen in the same age group!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Salamin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:57.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I watch you so much, \Nmy phone screen might crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:04:00.20,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,That stare of yours is like a destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.55,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Let's see. First up, for the music collab...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.80,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That'd be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.26,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Oh, Fu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.72,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,You're raring to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.68,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-This collab is a dream come true for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:09.77,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.65,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Well, about your collab partners...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.66,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Dang...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:15.65,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:19.33,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Outlaw and Sidebrah from the Outside Kids \Nare a no-show for the music collab?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:20.44,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,So sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:22.32,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.48,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:25.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Then what about the parts \Nsung by the Outside Kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.78,Default,Shura,0,0,0,,If they're not here, \Nwe'll have to split them between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:39.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs30\pos(212.167,117.833)}Shura
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:39.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\fs30\pos(212.167,117.833)}Sh{\c&HFFFFFF&}ura
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:39.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\an7\bord2\fs16\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(380,106.5)}Female singer renowned for the contrast\Nbetween her beautiful singing and\Nintense screams. Her {\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&}most-watched{\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\3c&H000000&}\Nvideo boasts over {\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&}40 million views!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:33.08,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:35.35,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,The female singer renowned for the contrast
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.46,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,between her beautiful singing \Nand intense screams!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:39.71,Default,Shura,0,0,0,,It's just us two. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.64,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.66,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.18,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,The game collab is with these whoopers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.23,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:46.96,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Tokage-san!
