Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:53.68,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Electric Eel Energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:58.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(439,21)}Electric Eel Energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:58.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(439,21)}El{\c&HFFFFFF&}ectric Eel Energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:58.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\an7\bord2\fs18\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(36,51)}Variety channel by a two-man unit. High-frequency,\Nhigh-quality videos {\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&}guaranteed to split your sides.{\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\3c&H000000&}\NThe members are Daifuku Minister and Garden Eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:56.06,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,A high-frequency, high-quality variety channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:58.40,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,run by the duo of \NDaifuku Minister and Garden Eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:02.50,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I try so hard to avoid people like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(191,1)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H645545&\frz351.9\fax-0.4\pos(288.5,182)}Daifuku
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:04.82,Default,Daifuku Minister,0,0,0,,Care for some daifuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.05,Default,Daifuku Minister,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.63,Default,Garden Eel,0,0,0,,Busting out the daifuku already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:09.86,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Tokage-san, let's have fun today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:10.86,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:12.08,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Whoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:14.84,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,And for the cooking collab...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.99,Default,Cast Iron Ken,0,0,0,,Hey, there. I'm Cast Iron Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:23.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\an7\bord2\fs16\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(448.5,60)}[Cast Iron Ken Channel]\N{\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&}Culinary specialist{\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\3c&H000000&}\Nwho lives by the motto,\N"Everyday cooking should be\N{\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&}tasty, fun, and easy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:23.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(421,226.5)\fs26}Cast Iron Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:23.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(421,226.5)\fs26}Cast {\c&HFFFFFF&}Iron Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.52,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Cast Iron Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.83,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,A culinary specialist who lives by the motto,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.21,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,"Everyday cooking \Nshould be tasty, fun, and easy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:25.05,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm Ichiko from MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:29.14,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um, your stuffed bell peppers \Nreally blew my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.44,Default,Cast Iron Ken,0,0,0,,They don't fall apart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:34.19,Default,Cast Iron Ken,0,0,0,,You're amazing too, Ichiko-chan, \Nalways making such huge portions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.01,Default,Cast Iron Ken,0,0,0,,How long have you been cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:37.35,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,About a hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.08,Default,Cast Iron Ken,0,0,0,,A hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:39.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:43.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, where's your quiz collab \Npartner, Plumb Wrong Logic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.99,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,Let's see, Pochi-san's comment...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:52.06,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,"The venue hall for today\N looks quite run-down."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.29,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,"Plumb Wrong Logic-san, \Nare you worried about a leaky roof?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:58.44,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,Well, it's true that run-down pipes \Npresent a leaking risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.56,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,but since it's not raining—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:05.05,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(174,14.5)}Plumb Wrong Logic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:05.05,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(174,14.5)}Plumb {\c&HFFFFFF&}Wrong Logic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:05.05,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\an7\bord2\fs18\c&H9C41E9&\3c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(29,120)}Construction streamer{\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\3c&H000000&}\Nwho debates current affairs\Nwhile performing plumbing work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.30,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Plumb Wrong Logic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:05.05,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,A construction streamer who debates current \Naffairs while performing plumbing work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.28,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,You see, not a lot of people know this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Plumb Wrong Logic-san, nice to meet—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.74,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,Oh, Live-san, my collab partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:12.51,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:15.31,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,PVC pipes are made of \Npolyvinyl chloride, are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:15.31,DefaultTop,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:19.98,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,We've got bottles of Mastamin Z \Nfrom our sponsor, AZO Pharma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.94,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Let's get pumped with heels for this show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:28.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Vampires pretending to be \Nhumans for an event...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.80,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I swear, they're such a handful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.19,Default,Girl Mob 1,0,0,0,,What, seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:33.33,Default,Girl Mob 1,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.26,Default,Girl Mob 1,0,0,0,,This online news article is wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.57,Default,Girl Mob 2,0,0,0,,Wait, that's Plumb Wrong Logic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:41.83,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,Outlaw... Sidebrah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:49.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,Three! Two! One!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.83,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.39,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.20,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.90,Default,Group,0,0,0,,How do you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.77,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone! TSUMA-shi here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:11.08,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Welcome to my TSUMA FES!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:17.87,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let's have \Nour participants take the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.79,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,First, introducing our two emcees!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:24.79,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,F. Taromaru and Salami N. Cappuccino!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:29.24,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Sponsored by AZO Pharma's Mastamin Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:32.01,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Open it to be hit with the bubble fizz \Nof its strong carbonation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.08,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Strong carbonation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:38.03,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Next, the singer you all know and love, Shura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.20,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.71,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.56,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,But now that it's underway, \Nwe just have to get through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.56,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Let's keep 'em coming! \NKen, the culinary expert!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:45.31,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,The construction streamer, Plumb Wrong Logic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:45.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's up to you now! Live! Ichiko! Fu! Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:49.69,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,And now, the new, up-and-coming channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:52.99,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:00.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's have a blast today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:04.96,DefaultItalics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I feel like a parent \Nwatching their kid's school play!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:08.21,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Now that we've wrapped up the intros...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:10.68,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,TSUMA FES Extreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.48,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.88,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:18.97,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,TSUMA FES Extreme is finally underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.08,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,From here on out, \Nyour emcees will be me, Taromaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.12,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,And me, Salamin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:26.77,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Our first segment is... the music collab!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:29.14,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Sing along with mi sol la si do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.50,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:33.24,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,The Outside Kids are a no-show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:40.03,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,I did the same thing \Nfor a part-time job once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:42.25,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,But this and that are different stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs30\fnArial Black\pos(523.5,63.5)\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&}Music Collab!!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H8829EC&\pos(523.5,63.5)\bord1.5\shad1}M{\c&HEED3D3&}us{\c&HEDF3D9&}ic {\c&H1FFFFE&}C{\c&H7FFF9D&}olla{\c&H1FFFFE&}b!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fnArial Black\pos(452.5,245.5)\bord2\shad1.5}~Let's Sing Those Timeless Hits~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:46.48,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Now then, here are Fu \Nand Shura in their first collab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.25,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:04.39,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,S-Such intensity!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:07.50,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Ah, I need to sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:21.33,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Was the audience this big before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:22.06,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:24.25,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Huh? Where in the song are...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.01,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:29.58,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.00,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,For our next collab...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:38.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs36\fnArial Black\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(490.5,53)}Game Collab!!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.88,0:09:38.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H8829EC&\bord1.5\shad1\pos(490.5,53)}G{\c&HF5DBDD&}am{\c&HF0FFDD&}e {\c&HFDFA6A&}C{\c&HC5FFC2&}olla{\c&HFCFD5B&}b!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:38.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fnArial Black\bord2\shad1.5\pos(253.5,187.5)}~This Ball & Chain is Nothing!\NRed Light, Green Light~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:36.64,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,A super-heavyweight game \Nof Red Light, Green Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.89,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,No life comes without shackles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:42.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko, you're up soon, so go wait off stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.89,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:47.13,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,The winner will be the first person \Nwho touches TSUMA-shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:47.13,DefaultTop,Garden Eel,0,0,0,,So heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:49.19,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,All for me, one for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.94,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:55.82,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Green light!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:55.58,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,None of the contestants are budging!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.57,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,A 30-kg weight is no joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.27,DefaultTop,Salami,0,0,0,,Tokage-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:58.32,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Red light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:04.69,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Green light...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.95,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:05.39,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Those whooping frat boys are a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.39,0:10:07.08,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.58,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,C-C-C-Could those voices be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:13.23,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,The Outside Kids, Outlaw and Sidebrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:15.84,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:21.09,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,A last-minute entry \Nafter ditching the music collab!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:22.94,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Green light, red light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.77,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.31,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Huh? Do we have more people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.89,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:30.50,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Green light...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:28.45,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,The game goes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:29.73,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,And they don't have chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:34.86,DefaultTop,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Red, red, red...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.65,DefaultItalics,Outlaw,0,0,0,,The two of us have always...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.86,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,...gone outside what's common sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.36,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.03,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.28,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:44.83,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,M-My word!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:48.29,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,With speed that defies common sense, \NMayoPan's Tokage is first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.67,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:51.68,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Why did you use your powers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.45,Default,Outlaw,0,0,0,,Defying common sense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:55.05,Default,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,That's one hell of an understatement!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.23,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:00.26,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.02,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Dearie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:06.39,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,The Outside Kids have suddenly made \Nconfessions of love to Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.72,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:11.24,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,She'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:12.40,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:16.40,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move on to the next segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\fnTimes New Roman\pos(451.5,236.5)\c&H487586&\3c&HA0CFDB&}Judge
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.61,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,I want to eat something yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.92,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Cooking Collab:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:23.66,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fs32\fnArial Black\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(268.5,18)}Cooking Collab!!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.40,0:11:23.66,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fs32\fnArial Black\c&H8829EC&\bord1.5\shad1\pos(268.5,18)}C{\c&HF8D1DE&}ooki{\c&HF5FDDE&}ng {\c&H8AFF8B&}C{\c&H4AF7F7&}olla{\c&H82FF7F&}b!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:23.66,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnArial Black\bord2\shad1.5\pos(221.5,208)}~How Will This Combination Taste?~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:23.66,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,How Will This Combination Taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.92,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Each chef will pick one card with a dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:29.54,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Combine the two culinary creations to \Ncomplete an outrageously good meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.17,Default,Group,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:34.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(647,1)\bord3\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H796462&\3c&HF5F6F1&}Mapo Tofu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.08,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:35.61,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:37.42,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Let's get cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:41.71,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Now, then, Ken's already \Nstarting to prep his ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:43.43,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,How about Ichiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:46.93,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,She's deep in thought \Nwhile staring at the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.49,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Whoa! Where's Ichiko off to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.82,DefaultItalics,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Is MayoPan's Ichiko running \Nfor her life off the stage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What is she {\i1}doing?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:01.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:07.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:09.45,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:12.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I was missing some ingredients, \Nso I went to buy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:14.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get back out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:17.63,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Cast Iron Ken's working that wok like a pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:20.04,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.13,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Oh, Ichiko has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:23.01,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Ichiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:27.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I would have gone instead if she'd asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:29.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:32.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There you are, alien tacos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Amigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:39.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:40.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A tortilla punch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:46.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Not-cho fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:53.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\an7\fs18\c&HBA8883&\3c&HD7F1E8&\pos(30,10)}[Ingredients]\NMastamin\NMastamin concentrate\NHoney\NGarlic\NGarlic extract\NCitric acid
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\an7\fs18\c&HBA8883&\3c&HD7F1E8&\pos(144,64)}Vitamin B2\NRoyal jelly\NGuarana extract\NCaffeine
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:56.28,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:58.21,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Both chefs have completed their dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:01.35,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,First up, Cast Iron Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:04.13,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,It's fried rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.84,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Now that looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:08.84,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Let's see what Ichiko's whipped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:10.88,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It might not have set yet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.53,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,A perfect complement, mapo tofu—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:14.93,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,A-Almond tofu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:15.98,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Almond tofu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:16.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(192,1)\fnTimes New Roman\pos(285.5,200)\c&H50B747&\3c&H50B747&\bord4\frz10.93\fax-0.35}Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.27,0:13:16.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(192,1)\fnTimes New Roman\pos(285.5,200)\c&H50B747&\3c&HFEFFF9&\bord2.5\frz10.93\fax-0.35}Milk
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:23.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(192,1)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H50B747&\3c&H50B747&\bord2.4\fax-0.32\fs14.4\pos(224.5,49.5)\frz12.07}Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.02,0:13:23.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(192,1)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H50B747&\3c&HFEFFF9&\bord1.5\fax-0.32\fs14.4\pos(224.5,49.5)\frz12.07}Milk
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:19.31,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,There wasn't any milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:22.07,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Sorry, but your dish was mapo tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.19,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:30.29,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I bombed the song, \Nand Tokage-san stole my faves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I've been instilled with fear and trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:35.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I misread the kanji and made the wrong dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.90,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You're fine! The crowd loved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.98,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mapo... Mapo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:40.58,DefaultItalics,Staff 2,0,0,0,,Live-san from MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:43.84,DefaultItalics,Staff 2,0,0,0,,It's time for your performance, \Nso please come right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:45.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No choice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.92,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Time for the quiz collab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.18,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,476)\fs8\bord1\pos(248,154.5)}Yukichi Survivor\NReia
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.18,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,476)\fs8\bord1\pos(322.5,163)}Plumb Wrong Logic
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.18,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,476)\fs8\bord1\pos(395.5,163)}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:56.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs36\fnArial Black\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(475.5,51)}Quiz Collab!!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.72,0:13:56.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H8829EC&\bord1.5\shad1\pos(475.5,51)}Q{\c&HF6CFD8&}ui{\c&HEEF5D6&}z {\c&H5544ED&}C{\c&H8BBBF0&}olla{\c&H949BF6&}b!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:56.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,893)\fnArial Black\bord2\shad1.5\pos(348.5,202)}~Lightning Fast! 100-Question Quiz in 10 Minutes~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:53.85,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,A hundred questions in ten minutes \Nto make the emcees cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:56.35,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Six seconds per question? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:14:00.85,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Plumb Wrong Logic-san, \Nhow are you feeling about this quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:02.34,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Plumb Wrong Logic-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:04.86,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like he's clammed up from nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.88,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Put away those wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:07.61,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Why don't we just say he's all fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.61,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't fly. Promise me you won't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:13.52,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Okay, it's just about time we get started...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All right, then go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:18.91,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Oh, here's Live-san from MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:20.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.84,Default,Group,0,0,0,,That moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.17,Default,Group,0,0,0,,She's flying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:29.58,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,M-MayoPan's Live, with an explosive entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:32.14,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Time to start our lightning-fast quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.31,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't fly, don't fly, don't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:34.61,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't you fly again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:37.58,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you get kicked out, there goes \Nour last chance to make a comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.10,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:41.35,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Okay, question number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:45.68,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Known as the "abalone of the fields," \Nwhat's TSUMA-shi's favorite vegetable?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.28,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Plumb Wrong Logic-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.11,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize for my actions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.41,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.61,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi's favorite vegetable is \Nzha cai, not an apology!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:55.00,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,Taro-chan, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:55.74,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:58.87,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(780,1)\bord2\c&H998B99&\fs12\3c&HF8F8F8&\frz-12.31\pos(322.5,58)}Top > NewTuber Roundup > NewTuber Scandals
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:58.87,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(780,1)\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\c&H7438E4&\fs24\3c&H282828&\frz-12.31\pos(403.5,112)}Affair {\c&HFEF4FD&}Uncovered!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:58.87,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(780,1)\an7\bord2\c&HA49C9E&\fs12\3c&HF8F8F8&\frz-12.31\pos(160,218)}Plumb Wrong Logic, NewTuber With Over\N1.6 Million Subscribers, Found Cheating
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.87,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,An apology {\i1}was{\i0} the right answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.53,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,I truly have nothing to say for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:02.58,DefaultTop,Crowd 1,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.38,Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this event!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:06.61,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:09.05,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, just get through this somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:13.62,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.40,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's gonna float up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.16,Default,Staff 3,0,0,0,,The Plumb-san news is real, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:20.02,Default,Staff 4,0,0,0,,What does this mean for the quiz collab?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.27,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:24.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let me borrow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.98,Default,Staff 3,0,0,0,,What? H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:27.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:31.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hang this rope down from the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.39,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Hang down? Ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:34.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't talk back! Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.45,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Okay, Ichiko, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:37.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu, you'll turn into a bat and get behind Live,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,hook the rope onto her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and then hold her down so she doesn't fly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.20,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Pull her down from below \Nso she doesn't fly away,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and even if she does, \Nwe can explain it away with the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.51,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:52.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, bat time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:53.59,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:16:01.06,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,I'm really, truly sorry for what I've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:00.52,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:10.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:12.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now we should be fine either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.72,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Ten minutes have passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.02,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:19.45,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,We'll have to save the other ninety-nine \Nquestions for some other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:20.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:22.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Our comeback chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:26.80,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Milk {\i1}does{\i0} get rid of garlic odor, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,we're talking almond tofu fried rice here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anything's worth a shot at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:37.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The almond tofu and fried rice \Nare happily having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's the dream I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:44.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.61,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Sorry to intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:50.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry for how Live acted earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:53.23,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,No, I should be the one apologizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:55.68,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,So sorry about Plumb Wrong Logic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:57.68,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,He ruined Live's first time on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:58.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi-san! Don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:16:59.66,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Non!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:03.78,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,I'll get the crowd fired up for part two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:05.96,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Let's make it an extremely great time together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.54,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:15.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:18.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi-san's doing so much for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but we haven't managed to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We can't go back like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:23.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:28.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll make sure our song \Nas MayoPan is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:33.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's make it a stellar performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go, MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.36,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:39.45,Default,Crowd 1,0,0,0,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:40.28,Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,A blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.99,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Sorry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.61,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Looks like we lost power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:48.53,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,We're looking into what caused it, \Nso be patient for a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:49.78,DefaultTop,Group,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:49.78,Default,Garden Eel,0,0,0,,Why'd the power go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:52.21,Default,Daifuku Minister,0,0,0,,My house lost power once from a water leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.37,Default,Daifuku Minister,0,0,0,,The pipes rusted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:57.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We might be able to fix the blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:57.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll go take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.14,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Be careful in the dark \Nor you could hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't you want to redeem your reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.19,Default,Group,0,0,0,,That's asking for a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The least we can do is try!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:20.26,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,A short circuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:24.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There might be a leak in this run-down venue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:28.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make the crowd \Nhear their song, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:31.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.06,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,That's not related to the power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.06,0:18:35.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.72,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,There's no circuitry near that leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.97,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,That's plumb wrong logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:41.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:42.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What now, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.58,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yukirinko knows who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:45.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:49.42,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mastamin Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.10,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.61,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Let's call it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:52.59,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.24,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,We can't keep the audience\N waiting any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.48,Default,Live,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:00.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey! There's no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:01.99,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Whazzis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:04.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Found a cute ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Under there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:19.13,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ribbon-san, are you trying \Nto rack up views, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:21.51,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,Are Outlaw and Sidebrah coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:25.25,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:26.89,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,There's no audio or lighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:28.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Our Masaki will figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:34.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Besides, even without a mic, I'm pretty loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll go ahead without mics!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:42.01,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,And if it doesn't work out, we'll beg on our \Nknees, or stomachs, or whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:44.53,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,How 'bout it? Will you gamble on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:46.95,Default,Outlaw,0,0,0,,You said it, Tokage-nee-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.76,0:19:52.17,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.04,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Let's give it a shot, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.73,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,TSUMA FES Extreme...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.78,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:19:59.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That hurts, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:03.15,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,Yes, this will mean it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.15,0:20:05.97,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,Even if it was scripted, \Nthat confession is just too awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.14,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! That cable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:08.31,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to protect those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.31,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hand it over already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:12.11,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,Thank you all so, {\i1}so{\i0} much for your patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:15.55,Default,Salami,0,0,0,,I know it's still dark, \Nbut we're starting the second half!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:17.77,Default,Taromaru,0,0,0,,First up on stage will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.86,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:33.21,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone get in the way of our love!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Keep it up! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:56.98,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Stop tripping and help me, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:21:00.23,Default,Pien,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to save the two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:20.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We've worked so hard preparing for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:33.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We need people like {\i1}you{\i0}\N to hit the subscribe button,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:37.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,so we've spent countless hours\N coming up with ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:02.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:05.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I was the one who wanted to see it the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:24.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:27.80,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Today's event got us even closer \Nto one million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.63,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Now I can finally upsize my beef bowls!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:31.38,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's right! You can even add an egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:31.63,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,An egg?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:32.41,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,With tonjiru on the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:33.18,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Tonjiru!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:36.18,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Welcome. \NThis Is Your New Family Home Now!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:36.18,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2E2C40&}Welcome. This Is Your New Family Home Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.18,0:23:38.43,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Order up! One large, add an egg and tonjiru!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.02,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The big dream I've waited for!
